#: doctor-subs.php
#. Description of the plugin
msgid ""
"Find and fix broken WooCommerce subscriptions. Detects ghost subs, "
"stuck-on-hold renewals, and repeated payment failures, with one-click "
"reversible fixes."
msgstr ""
"Encuentra y soluciona suscripciones rotas de WooCommerce. Detecta ghost "
"subs, renovaciones bloqueadas en espera y fallos de pago repetidos, con "
"correcciones reversibles con un solo clic."

