"no programó el evento de pago, por lo que no se cobró nada."

#: includes/rules/class-rule-ghost-sub.php:296
#, php-format
msgid ""
"%1$s's subscription was supposed to renew on <em>%2$s</em> (%3$d days ago). "
"WordPress didn't schedule the payment event, so nothing was charged."
msgstr ""
"La suscripción de %1$s se suponía que se renovaría el <em>%2$s</em> (hace "
