"nada."

#: includes/rules/class-rule-ghost-sub.php:301
#, php-format
msgid ""
"%1$s's subscription was supposed to renew on <em>%2$s</em>, about %3$d days "
"ago. WordPress didn't schedule the payment event, so %1$s hasn't been "
"billed for any cycles since."
msgstr ""
"La suscripción de %1$s se suponía que se renovaría el <em>%2$s</em>, hace "
"alrededor de %3$d días. WordPress no programó el evento de pago, por lo que "
"%1$s no ha sido facturado por ningún ciclo desde entonces."

#: includes/rules/class-rule-ghost-sub.php:306
#, php-format
